SUMMARY:NeurIPS 2026: check whether the volunteer page is live
DESCRIPTION:Check whether the 2026 volunteer and financial assistance pag
 e is live and confirm the real 2026 dates. As of 2026-07-22 this URL ret
 urned HTTP 404\, so every volunteer date in this guide is expected rathe
 r than confirmed. Also check the pricing page for the student rate. http
 s://neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/FinancialAssistance
