END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neurips2026-volunteer-apply-20260901@neurips-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260906T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
SUMMARY:NeurIPS 2026 volunteer applications did not open on this expected
  date
DESCRIPTION:Did not happen. This 1 September date was inferred from the 2
 025 programme and did not hold. The real opening date is 7 SEPTEMBER 202
 6\, published on the volunteer page and confirmed 2026-09-06. See the 7 
 September event. https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/FinancialAssistance
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neurips2026-registration-opens-20260903@neurips-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260902T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260903
SUMMARY:NeurIPS registration opens 23:00 AEST\, first come first served
DESCRIPTION:Registration for NeurIPS 2026 opens today at 23:00 AEST (13:0
 0 UTC) for the Sydney and Atlanta sites\, first come first served with a
  waitlist once capacity is reached. The Paris opening date had not been 
 announced as of 2026-09-02. Confirmed on 2026-09-02 from the official da
 tes page. Registration amounts were still unpublished on that date\, so 
 budget from the early deadline of 30 October AoE and the full-refund can
 cellation date of 4 November AoE. https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/Pr
 icing
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neurips2026-applications-open-20260907@neurips-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260906T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260907
SUMMARY:NeurIPS volunteer and financial assistance applications OPEN toda
 y
DESCRIPTION:Both programs open today\, 7 September 2026\, confirmed from 
 the official volunteer and financial assistance page on 2026-09-06. Volu
 nteer applications are open for Sydney and Atlanta now. Paris opens in l
 ate September. Apply at https://neurips.cc/Volunteers/volunteerapplicati
 on . Volunteers work two shifts of about four hours each at the venue\, 
 buy registration up front and are refunded after completing the shifts. 
 The refund covers BOTH Conference Sessions & Tutorials AND Workshops & C
 ompetitions\, so the workshop days are included. No hotel for volunteers
 . You may apply for both the grant and the volunteer program but will no
 t be selected for both. Submitting early costs nothing\, since you may e
 dit until the deadline.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neurips2026-author-notifications-20260924@neurips-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260806T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260924
SUMMARY:NeurIPS 2026 author notifications: reassess financial assistance 
 versus volunteering
DESCRIPTION:Confirmed date taken from the official 2026 dates page. Autho
 rs can weigh financial assistance against volunteering\, because both ma
 y be applied for but only one can be won. Without an accepted paper\, vo
 lunteering is usually the stronger route\, because financial assistance 
 prioritises authors. https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/Dates
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neurips2026-volunteer-deadline-buffer-20260930@neurips-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260906T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:NeurIPS volunteer and financial assistance deadline buffer
DESCRIPTION:Buffer day\, two days before the real deadline. The confirmed
  2026 deadline for BOTH the volunteer and financial assistance programs 
 is 6 October 2026 23:59 AoE\, published on the volunteer page and confir
 med 2026-09-06. This event previously sat on 30 September\, a date infer
 red from the 2025 programme before the real one was published. Confirm y
 our application is submitted and saved. NeurIPS evaluates only the lates
 t saved version and sends no confirmation email for financial assistance
 . https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/FinancialAssistance
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neurips2026-applications-deadline-20261006@neurips-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260906T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261006
SUMMARY:NeurIPS volunteer and financial assistance DEADLINE 23:59 AoE
DESCRIPTION:Confirmed 2026 deadline for BOTH programs\, 6 October 2026 23
 :59 Anywhere on Earth\, from the official volunteer and financial assist
 ance page\, confirmed 2026-09-06. AoE means it passes when it is still 6
  October anywhere on the planet\, so the practical Sydney cut-off is lat
 e on 7 October. Do not rely on that margin. Financial assistance locatio
 n selections are FINAL after this deadline. https://neurips.cc/Conferenc
 es/2026/FinancialAssistance
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neurips2026-fa-decisions-20261014@neurips-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260906T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
SUMMARY:NeurIPS financial assistance decisions due by today (23:59 AoE)
DESCRIPTION:Confirmed 2026 date: financial assistance applicants are noti
 fied by 14 October 2026 23:59 AoE\, six days before volunteer decisions.
  Confirmed 2026-09-06. Award and hotel offers may carry short acceptance
  windows\, about 48 hours per the NeurIPS FAQ\, so watch your inbox and 
 spam folder. If you win an award\, decline it promptly if you will not u
 se it so it can be reallocated. https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/Fina
 ncialAssistance
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neurips2026-decisions-expected-20261010@neurips-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260906T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261020
SUMMARY:NeurIPS volunteer decisions due by today (23:59 AoE)
DESCRIPTION:Confirmed 2026 date: NeurIPS notifies volunteer applicants by
  20 October 2026 23:59 AoE. This event previously sat on 10 October\, a 
 date inferred from the 2025 programme before the real one was published.
  Confirmed 2026-09-06. If accepted\, confirm shift dates and the refund 
 process. If rejected\, ask a supervisor or school about conference funds
  the same week and check affinity group schemes. This lands ten days bef
 ore early pricing ends on 30 October\, so there is real time to act. htt
 ps://neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/FinancialAssistance
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neurips2026-early-registration-deadline-20261030@neurips-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260828T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261030
SUMMARY:NeurIPS early registration deadline (AoE)
DESCRIPTION:Early registration pricing for NeurIPS 2026 ends today\, 30 O
 ctober 2026 Anywhere on Earth. Confirmed on 2026-08-28 from the official
  dates page and from the pricing page countdown. Register on or before t
 his date to pay the early rate. Amounts were still unpublished as of 202
 6-08-28. https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/Pricing
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neurips2026-cancellation-deadline-20261104@neurips-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260828T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261104
SUMMARY:NeurIPS last day for full-refund cancellation (AoE)
DESCRIPTION:Last day to cancel a NeurIPS 2026 registration for a full ref
 und\, 4 November 2026 Anywhere on Earth. Registrations cannot be cancell
 ed or refunded after this date. Confirmed on 2026-08-28 from the pricing
  page. Note that if the meeting is sold out\, a cancelled ticket returns
  to a reserve pool and you likely will not be able to re-register\, so c
 ancelling protects the money rather than the seat. https://neurips.cc/Co
 nferences/2026/Pricing
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
